    "rationale": "No present finding above low is supported by the reviewed artifacts because only trusted employee questions and internal design docs reach the existing reply sink, and the reply channel is constrained to the authenticated requester with no network egress. Forecast rises to high if the planned Jira MCP server is added, because untrusted customer-authored ticket content would then be able to influence answers that can include confidential design-doc content, while the only stated content-separation control is a behavioral prompt instruction."
